flowchart TD
    Start([Citizen Submits Hazard Report]) --> CheckNet{Internet Connection Available?}
    CheckNet -- No --> CacheLocal[Save to Local SQLite Queue]
    CacheLocal --> WaitConn[Poll Network Availability]
    WaitConn --> CheckNet
    CheckNet -- Yes --> PushAPI[Transmit Payload to API Gateway]
    PushAPI --> Geocode[PostGIS Point-in-Polygon Administrative Lookup]
    Geocode --> AIDedup[AI Deduplication & Temporal Clustering]
    AIDedup --> CheckCluster{Duplicate Cluster Found?}
    CheckCluster -- Yes --> MergeIncident[Merge Evidence into Cluster Parent]
    CheckCluster -- No --> CreateNew[Initialize New Incident Record]
    MergeIncident --> NotifyWoreda[Alert Woreda Disaster Desk]
    CreateNew --> NotifyWoreda
    NotifyWoreda --> FieldInspect[Woreda Focal Person Field Ground-Check]
    FieldInspect --> VerifyDecision{Is Hazard Validated?}
    VerifyDecision -- False Alarm --> Reject[Mark Status: REJECTED_FALSE_ALARM]
    VerifyDecision -- Confirmed --> Verify[Mark Status: VERIFIED]
    Verify --> CheckSeverity{Severity Level >= 3?}
    CheckSeverity -- Yes --> Escalation[Escalate to EDRMC & Regional Director for Alert Sign-off]
    CheckSeverity -- No --> LocalDispatch[Dispatch Local Kebele/Woreda First Responders]
    Escalation --> End([Response Coordination & Monitoring])
    LocalDispatch --> End
    Reject --> End
